{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Hey Nate, long time no see! My laptop crashed last week and I lost all my work - super frustrating! As a writer, my laptop is like half of my lifeline so losing all progress was like a major blow."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-42/session_21-c6d8972aaa69df8c94dc9522", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T14:08:59.009021+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c6d8972aaa69df8c94dc9522", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c6d8972aaa69df8c94dc9522", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Hey Joanna, sorry to hear about that. Losing so much progress must be really frustrating. Did you manage to recover anything? Maybe consider backing up your work in the future?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-42/session_21-e75c4b083223676bf90caec0", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T14:09:03.140263+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e75c4b083223676bf90caec0", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e75c4b083223676bf90caec0", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Thanks for the sympathy, Nate. Nothing was recoverable, but now I have an external drive for backups. I never want to go through this again. So, how have you been? Making anything cool?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-42/session_21-49ace9604e39b891ede56139", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T14:09:07.282234+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "49ace9604e39b891ede56139", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "49ace9604e39b891ede56139", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Hey Joanna, I'm no writer like you, but something pretty awesome happened. Last Monday I got to teach people vegan ice cream recipes on my own cooking show! It was a bit nerve-wracking to put myself out there, but it was a blast. Plus, I picked up a few new recipes!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-42/session_21-80ea2711d849997f749216a4", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T14:09:11.425056+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "80ea2711d849997f749216a4", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "80ea2711d849997f749216a4", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Way to go, Nate! Congrats on the cooking show, I'll definitely be tuning in! What's your favorite dish from the show?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-42/session_21-7dba3809b187a5c52ad7a209", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T14:09:15.532768+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7dba3809b187a5c52ad7a209", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7dba3809b187a5c52ad7a209", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Coconut milk ice cream is at the top of my list. It's so smooth and creamy with a tropical coconut twist. Plus, it's dairy-free for people who can't have lactose or who want vegan options. Here's a snap of the ice cream I made."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-42/session_21-f6f118bbef98d621344858bf", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T14:09:19.712196+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f6f118bbef98d621344858bf", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f6f118bbef98d621344858bf", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Wow, that looks amazing, Nate! I love the color and texture. It's great that you're making these options. Could you share the recipe? I'd love to try making it sometime!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-42/session_21-916ac66232ffcb06f4e0e381", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T14:09:23.883254+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "916ac66232ffcb06f4e0e381", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "916ac66232ffcb06f4e0e381", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Yeah sure! Would love to share it. Let's spread the joy of dairy-free options! Let me know when you make it!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-42/session_21-4acbcfe2d050509829fe3bd1", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T14:09:28.021609+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4acbcfe2d050509829fe3bd1", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4acbcfe2d050509829fe3bd1", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Cool, Nate! Gonna give it a go. Dairy-free is a must for me, especially for desserts. Last Friday, I made a deeeelish dessert with almond milk - it was good! Got any favs when it comes to dairy-free desserts?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-42/session_21-af809d816cb58c4de9878196", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T14:09:32.137375+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "af809d816cb58c4de9878196", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "af809d816cb58c4de9878196", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Coconut milk ice cream is one of my favorites as you might be able to tell, but I also love a dairy-free chocolate mousse. It's super creamy and tastes like the real thing. What's been your favorite dairy-free sweet treat so far?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-42/session_21-2592ec8e081c84cbc28c2181", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T14:09:36.265431+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2592ec8e081c84cbc28c2181", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2592ec8e081c84cbc28c2181", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Hey Nate, my favorite dairy-free treat is this amazing chocolate raspberry tart. It has an almond flour crust, chocolate ganache, and fresh raspberries - it's delicious!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-42/session_21-057a5bb1f4ee616aeb27126f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T14:09:40.392651+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "057a5bb1f4ee616aeb27126f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "057a5bb1f4ee616aeb27126f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: That looks amazing, Joanna! I need to try baking that. What other treats do you like making?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-42/session_21-4a69a2fd590f5d1483322518", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T14:09:44.544856+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4a69a2fd590f5d1483322518", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4a69a2fd590f5d1483322518", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Hey Nate, I love making this dairy-free chocolate cake with raspberries. It's so moist and delicious - perfect sweetness level."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-42/session_21-54d2f3e248051b570212c015", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T14:09:48.701902+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "54d2f3e248051b570212c015", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "54d2f3e248051b570212c015", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: That cake looks amazing, Joanna! How did you make it?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-42/session_21-2afcfc173f4472fbb54a7e37", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T14:09:52.813868+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2afcfc173f4472fbb54a7e37", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2afcfc173f4472fbb54a7e37", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: I make it with almond flour, coconut oil, chocolate and raspberries. It's my favorite for birthdays and special days."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-42/session_21-5a4e00ad1d7fa6fcaab96394", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T14:09:56.915598+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5a4e00ad1d7fa6fcaab96394", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5a4e00ad1d7fa6fcaab96394", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Yum, Joanna! Gotta try that one. Any others you want to share?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-42/session_21-00fa384fdbff81459beb0ec5", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T14:10:01.021876+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "00fa384fdbff81459beb0ec5", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "00fa384fdbff81459beb0ec5", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Hey Nate! Here's another recipe I like. It's a delicious dessert made with blueberries, coconut milk, and a gluten-free crust. So creamy and delicious!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-42/session_21-f2971f67106efb7d572a1961", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T14:10:05.156761+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f2971f67106efb7d572a1961", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f2971f67106efb7d572a1961", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Wow, Joanna! That dessert looks amazing. I'll definitely have to give it a try. Thanks!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-42/session_21-e8b8e043b31526ff20ca3598", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T14:10:09.276703+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e8b8e043b31526ff20ca3598", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e8b8e043b31526ff20ca3598", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Glad to help, Nate. Let me know if you try it. I'm sure you'll enjoy it. It was great chatting."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-42/session_21-85be89619ef9400dfbc6a4d9", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T14:10:13.409975+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "85be89619ef9400dfbc6a4d9", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "85be89619ef9400dfbc6a4d9", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Thanks Joanna! I will. Bye!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-42/session_21-a47e9b3b9d948fa1a1d65aac", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T14:10:17.504708+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a47e9b3b9d948fa1a1d65aac", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a47e9b3b9d948fa1a1d65aac", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
